# What a root-level `vercel deploy` must never upload. The project's Root Directory is
# apps/admin, so a hand deploy has to be run from here — and the CLI then ships the whole
# checkout, ignored files included. Deployment dpl_9xpTHaaq6uus7zf7dS2LTkeksi93 (2026-09-05)
# carried the root .env and supabase/.temp/ that way, which is why this file exists.
# (git-triggered deployments never had the problem: they build from the commit.)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
supabase/.temp/
apps/mobile/build/
apps/mobile/.dart_tool/
apps/admin/.env
apps/admin/.env.*
!apps/admin/.env.example
*.apk
*.aab
.git/
